  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New managers Ukraine 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nya managers Ukraina 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet inneb&#xE4;r att ett antal Ukrainska praktikanter f&#xE5;r praktisera p&#xE5; svenska f&#xF6;retag. Programmets &#xF6;verordnade m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att skapa f&#xF6;retagskontakter mellan Ukraina och Sverige samtidigt som programmet erbjuder kompetensutveckling f&#xF6;r yngre ledare inom n&#xE4;ringslivet i Ukraina samt &#xF6;kar kunskapen om och intresset f&#xF6;r Ukraina bland svenska f&#xF6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists in several internships at Swedish companies for Ukrainian trainees. The overall objective is to create business contacts between Ukraine and Sweden, offer competence development of young Ukrainian business managers but also increase the knowledge about and the interest for Ukraina among Swedish companies.</narrative>
  </description>
